### S02
EFFORT: targeted
ASKED: yes

Before I write this prompt, two parts of the request contradict each other, and one thing I cannot know without you.

**1 - Fully offline vs. every save needing a connection**
You asked for the app to work fully offline, and for every save to require an internet connection to sync. Those pull against each other: working offline means saving has to work when there is no connection at all.
- Saves are stored on the device immediately, and sync to the team whenever a connection is available (offline-first).
- Saves fail unless there is a connection (online-only) - then the app does not really work offline.
- **Not sure - pick what makes sense for a small team**
My suggestion: offline-first.

**2 - Professional look vs. no CSS at all**
You asked for a professional look but no CSS at all. In a web app these cannot both hold - CSS is the only way a browser styles anything; HTML alone renders as plain, unstyled text.
- Avoid hand-writing CSS by using a ready-made component library.
- Use no CSS at all, and accept a plain unstyled look.
- It is not a web app - target desktop or mobile instead.
- **Not sure - you choose**
My suggestion: use a component library and keep the professional look.

**3 - What should this be built with?**
No existing project was detected, so I have nothing to anchor to.
- Web app (runs in a browser)
- Desktop app
- Mobile app
- **Not sure - pick what fits a small team**
My suggestion: a web app.

